  "name": "Splat Repair (repair brush editor for Gaussian splats)",
  "summary": "Desktop editor for Gaussian splat scans: paint over a sign or floater and Fast Fill rebuilds the surface by copying nearby splats (CPU, ~0.3-1.5 s on 550k splats). Optional Deep Fill uses LaMa inpainting on NVIDIA GPUs; also brush/lasso selection, clone stamp and floater cleanup. Reads/writes PLY, SPLAT, SPZ.",
